# GitHub Linguist Overrides
# Ensures GitHub displays the repository as a Flutter (Dart) project
admin_panel/** linguist-vendored
backend_api/** linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-detectable=false
*.lock linguist-detectable=false
*.md linguist-documentation
mobile_app/** linguist-detectable=true

# Git Line Endings
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
